WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Support your forearm comfortably.
Watch the relaxed hand position.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Gently bend, then ease the fingers open.
No need to make a fist.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Relax. Do not force stiff fingers.
This is a simplified model.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Watch again: a small comfortable motion.
Keep your wrist comfortable.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Pause and rest.
Contact with the palm is not a goal.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A final example, at normal speed.
Use only your own easy range.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Relax your hand.
A small movement counts.
